From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 18:08:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 102/117] Input: apple_z2: Add explicit D11 variant support

Model generic, J172, D11, and D111 hardware with explicit match data so
shared iPhone 7 Plus behavior cannot be confused with exact
board-specific rules.

Add the D11 firmware, calibration limits, power sequence, SPI framing,
and coordinate handling. D111 remains filtered to its known 0x44 runtime
report type, while D11 retains length-based dispatch until a capture
establishes its report identifier.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: 2ad7e123be06f5beb8f5c97c82a5217d9b877325
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c | 289 +++++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 187 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)

